 annual revenue.","Gross margins of 80% are the starting point for assessing pricing power.","The business throws off $171M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 29 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","Accruals are elevated at -93.9% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, interest coverage of 40\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Shareholder yield is only 0.6%, a thin return of capital, and stock-based comp at 109% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 4.7% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 475% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 2 other valuation measures)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":4.747396951024907},{"text":"Operating margins 93% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Elevated short interest (10.2% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $92.6M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Patent cliffs, drug-pricing reform, and reimbursement pressure \u2014 a single regulatory change can reset the pricing power that justifies the multiple.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Clinical trial concentration risk \u2014 binary FDA outcomes on a lead asset can wipe out billions in market cap in a single session.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 15% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (30.3% return)","Healthcare tends to hold up well as investors rotate into defensive names"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Hinge Health (NYSE:HNGE) Price Target Raised to $131.00","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/hinge-health-nysehnge-price-target-raised-to-131-00.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793955407.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.202,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"Hinge Health (NYSE:HNGE) Price Target Raised to $134.00","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/hinge-health-nysehnge-price-target-raised-to-134-00.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793950250.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.511,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"Hinge Health (HNGE) Stock Looks About Right On A 166% Run","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/healthcare/nyse-hnge/hinge-health/news/hinge-health-hnge-stock-looks-about-right-on-a-166-run","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793839668.691,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.948,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Hinge Health (NYSE:HNGE) Reaches New 1-Year Hig